# CMA-ES initials file for powercap optimization
# Only optional settings are provided here to avoid overriding
# the dimension and initial mean/stddev that we set in code.

## --- OPTIONAL SETTINGS (stopping and runtime)

# Termination thresholds (tune as needed)
stopFitness 1e-9 
stopMaxFunEvals   1e299
stopMaxIter       10
stopTolFun        1
stopTolFunHist    1
stopTolX          1e-11
stopTolUpXFactor  1e3

seed 0

maxTimeFractionForEigendecompostion 1


